1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,430
It was a normal day at PUP.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,420
Until I reached for my ID...

3
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:05,630
...and it was gone.

4
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:07,010
I checked my bag.

5
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:08,480
My desk.

6
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,250
The canteen.

7
00:00:10,350 --> 00:00:11,520
Nothing.

8
00:00:11,950 --> 00:00:13,610
So I did what everyone does.

9
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:15,320
I posted in the group chat.

10
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:17,910
In seconds, my post was buried.

11
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:23,540
Even the admin office just had a box of lost things.

12
00:00:23,950 --> 00:00:27,050
Meanwhile, Marco found my ID near the Main Building.

13
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:30,090
Instead of another group chat, he opened FoundIt.

14
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:32,930
A photo, a place, a caption.

15
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,860
Posted in seconds.

16
00:00:34,910 --> 00:00:36,750
Right there on the campus feed.

17
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:37,950
Then my phone buzzed.

18
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,550
Someone found my item.

19
00:00:39,600 --> 00:00:42,030
But I couldn't just say "that's mine."

20
00:00:42,080 --> 00:00:45,390
I had to answer questions only the real owner would know.

21
00:00:45,440 --> 00:00:47,820
Someone else tried to claim it, and got rejected.

22
00:00:47,870 --> 00:00:49,030
Mine matched.

23
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:53,960
We met at the admin office, and I got my ID back.

24
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:55,500
No buried posts.

25
00:00:55,550 --> 00:00:56,450
No guessing.

26
00:00:56,500 --> 00:00:57,200
FoundIt.

27
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:57,940
Post it.

28
00:00:57,970 --> 00:01:00,050
Verify it. Return it.

